{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q2", "domain": "relationship", "question": "婚姻如何？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字与紫微斗数综合推断：\n\n八字方面，戊土日主生于亥月，年干辛金伤官高透，年支卯木正官夫星坐下被辛金克制，形成“伤官见官”之局，对婚姻极为不利。日支夫宫午火为印星，火炎土燥，夫星难以得位。伤官在年柱，主早年婚姻即有波折，有克夫之象。\n\n紫微斗数盘中，夫妻宫在辰，身宫落于此，主星天机（得）加天梁（庙），辅以地劫。天机天梁为孤克组合，地劫则加重破裂、分离之应。对宫官禄宫见擎羊、天姚，夫缘有损。命宫天喜逢天空，迁移宫红鸾引动，看似有桃花，实则易聚易散。福德宫陀罗自寻烦恼，田宅宫廉破陷落，家宅不宁，整体婚姻结构脆弱，易有生离死别之象。\n\n综合八字伤官克官与紫微夫妻宫天机天梁地劫的孤克信号，以“夫早亡”最为符合命理趋势。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1c", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q2", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1c_R0_P1_G0\\details_2025_b1c_R0_P1_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 20688, "response_id": "9ff3cdeb-315d-4487-96e1-7701f0eaa8cd", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 727, "completion_tokens": 1221, "total_tokens": 1948, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 640}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 952}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 640, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 87}}
